  "description": {
    "en": "Wilson NXT 16 is a premium multifilament string built with proprietary Xycro microfibers impregnated with polyurethane for high comfort, power and shock absorption. Its X-bonded core is designed to improve tension maintenance and sustain pace over longer periods of play. Wilson also claims a 10% larger sweet spot than traditional synthetic gut with significantly reduced shock. The 1.30 mm / 16 gauge version emphasizes greater durability and control compared with NXT 17 while retaining the plush, powerful character of the NXT family.",

    "zh": "Wilson NXT 16 是一款高端多芯球线，采用专有 Xycro 微纤维并注入 Polyurethane 聚氨酯，以提供出色的舒适性、力量和减震表现。X-Bonded Core 结构用于提升保磅和长期力量输出。Wilson 同时表示，NXT 相比传统 Synthetic Gut 拥有约 10% 更大的 Sweet Spot，并显著减少击球冲击。1.30 毫米 / 16 规格相比 NXT 17 更厚，因此更强调耐久和控制，同时依然保持 NXT 系列标志性的柔软、Plush 和高力量表现。"
  },

